WEBVTT

00:15.700 --> 00:17.370
Honoka's still feeling down?

00:17.760 --> 00:23.410
I heard she quit being a school idol after she got into an argument with Umi-chan and the others.

00:23.410 --> 00:26.750
And Kotori-chan's been absent to prepare to study abroad.

00:26.750 --> 00:29.790
So that's why she hasn't been talking to Umi-chan lately?

00:30.320 --> 00:32.720
Then this is where we come in!

00:35.050 --> 00:36.430
Honoka!

00:36.430 --> 00:38.190
Wanna walk home together for a change?

00:38.190 --> 00:38.850
Huh?

00:39.810 --> 00:40.770
Sure.

00:40.770 --> 00:42.830
You've got nothing to do after school now, right?

00:42.830 --> 00:43.870
Hey!

00:43.870 --> 00:46.110
What? It's not like this is a sensitive topic.

00:46.110 --> 00:49.110
Her hard work's paid off, and now the school isn't in danger of shutting down.

00:49.110 --> 00:50.780
Yeah, but...

00:50.780 --> 00:53.630
She became a school idol to save the school

00:53.630 --> 00:56.240
and quit once she achieved her goal.

00:56.240 --> 00:58.470
There's nothing to worry about anymore.

00:58.470 --> 00:59.180
Right?

01:00.040 --> 01:01.750
Yeah.

01:01.750 --> 01:04.500
Everyone in school appreciates what you did.

01:04.830 --> 01:05.710
Yeah, that's right!

01:05.710 --> 01:09.850
So many people found out about our school thanks to µ's!

01:10.780 --> 01:11.930
Thanks.

01:12.300 --> 01:13.550
Now, let's go!

01:13.550 --> 01:14.390
Okay!

01:18.600 --> 01:20.930
You've been practicing pretty hard lately.

01:20.930 --> 01:23.730
Of course. The competition is drawing near, after all.

01:24.180 --> 01:27.390
You're really done with the school idol thing?

01:37.580 --> 01:39.770
I wonder if this is for the best.

01:41.180 --> 01:45.590
You're the one who said it wouldn't be µ's without all nine members, Nozomi.

01:45.590 --> 01:46.930
I know, but...

01:47.420 --> 01:48.920
We're going on hiatus?

01:48.920 --> 01:53.630
Yes. I think we all need to take some time to reflect.

01:55.140 --> 01:57.330
We dropped out of the contest for Love Live,

01:57.330 --> 01:58.760
and now we're going on hiatus?

01:58.760 --> 02:02.530
I don't see much meaning in continuing at this point.

02:02.530 --> 02:06.050
Without Honoka, µ's is as good as dead.

02:10.360 --> 02:13.550
Honestly, even if Honoka hadn't said anything,

02:13.550 --> 02:16.030
we would've run into this problem eventually.

02:16.720 --> 02:20.150
Though it's only for another year, they decided to keep the school open,

02:20.150 --> 02:25.590
so we had to think of a new goal to strive toward.

02:27.840 --> 02:29.420
What are you guys going to do?

02:29.920 --> 02:31.210
What do you mean?

02:31.210 --> 02:33.590
I'm talking about idol activities!

02:33.590 --> 02:35.550
Do you have any intention of continuing?

02:36.260 --> 02:37.630
Will you continue being an idol with me?

02:39.040 --> 02:40.390
Nico-chan...

02:52.160 --> 02:52.930
Isn't it delicious?

02:52.930 --> 02:53.730
Yeah!

02:54.620 --> 02:56.010
You're eating too much!

02:56.010 --> 02:57.690
But it's so good!

02:58.370 --> 03:00.030
Almost there!

03:03.730 --> 03:05.950
Awesome! Keep going!

03:09.960 --> 03:10.000
Love Live!

03:21.730 --> 03:26.850
Sincerity is what links us together

03:26.850 --> 03:29.270
We may be serious, but we're still inexperienced

03:29.270 --> 03:31.690
Our minds clash

03:31.690 --> 03:34.280
But we still want to

03:34.280 --> 03:36.480
Pursue big dreams

03:36.480 --> 03:38.400
The goal's right there

03:38.400 --> 03:40.820
We've just started

03:40.820 --> 03:43.400
I know

03:42.050 --> 03:43.910
It won't be all fun and games

03:43.910 --> 03:45.910
We'll have to face challenges

03:45.910 --> 03:47.580
I know

03:46.870 --> 03:50.830
There'll be hardships along the way

03:50.830 --> 03:52.800
Still, let's go

03:51.870 --> 03:55.960
So long as we're together, each of us will bloom

03:55.960 --> 03:57.000
I'm sure

03:57.000 --> 03:59.550
After a series of transformations

03:58.720 --> 04:00.630
we'll be stars

04:00.630 --> 04:05.720
If we all put our hearts into doing what we love

04:05.720 --> 04:08.350
A new place

04:08.620 --> 04:10.440
will be our goal

04:10.440 --> 04:15.380
Believing in what each of us loves to do

04:15.380 --> 04:18.380
We embrace our excitement

04:18.380 --> 04:20.360
And move forward

04:20.360 --> 04:23.360
Stop being afraid

04:23.360 --> 04:25.740
Just put a big smile on your face

04:25.740 --> 04:28.330
And jump up high

04:28.330 --> 04:33.400
We're all living this moment

04:34.810 --> 04:38.460
Waiting for the spotlight to shine on us

04:43.240 --> 04:44.510
Umi-chan!

04:44.510 --> 04:45.760
Welcome!

04:45.760 --> 04:48.030
I thought you'd be here sooner. Were you at practice?

04:45.840 --> 04:50.770
"µ's Music Start!"

04:48.030 --> 04:48.870
Yes.

04:57.460 --> 04:59.610
Did you turn her down too?

04:59.610 --> 05:01.010
Yes.

05:01.010 --> 05:03.820
I understand why Nico wants to continue,

05:03.820 --> 05:05.230
but as much as I'd like to...

05:06.300 --> 05:08.010
What is it? Why can't you?

05:08.860 --> 05:13.620
I became a school idol only because you and Honoka asked me.

05:15.640 --> 05:16.620
Sorry.

05:16.620 --> 05:20.190
Don't be sorry. I'm not trying to place blame on anyone.

05:20.840 --> 05:23.700
I <i>did</i> yell at Honoka...

05:23.700 --> 05:26.610
but I'm also part of the reason she quit!

05:26.610 --> 05:28.210
That's not true!

05:28.210 --> 05:30.970
It's because I was taking so long to tell her I'm leaving!

05:31.860 --> 05:32.990
Have you talked to her since then?

05:34.240 --> 05:36.230
You're leaving the country soon, aren't you?

05:37.920 --> 05:38.590
Yeah.

05:40.230 --> 05:41.250
Kotori...

05:42.640 --> 05:44.570
Are you really going to study abroad?

05:44.570 --> 05:45.490
Huh?

05:45.490 --> 05:46.530
I'm...

05:47.420 --> 05:48.770
Umi-chan...

05:48.770 --> 05:50.870
No, never mind.

05:52.540 --> 05:55.870
It's too late. I can't turn back now.

05:57.860 --> 05:59.290
I know.

06:04.420 --> 06:06.300
You can do it!

06:06.760 --> 06:07.550
You won!

06:07.550 --> 06:10.310
I didn't think she could beat me!

06:10.310 --> 06:12.030
You two are next. Come on, Honoka.

06:12.030 --> 06:12.550
Huh?

06:12.550 --> 06:14.010
You don't stand a chance!

06:14.010 --> 06:15.640
I'm really good at this game!

06:15.640 --> 06:17.020
Bring it!

06:22.480 --> 06:24.350
Here we go!

06:38.500 --> 06:41.950
<i>One, two, three, four! Five, six, seven, eight!</i>

06:41.950 --> 06:43.710
<i>One, two, three, four!</i>

06:43.710 --> 06:45.890
Honoka, it's started!

06:51.680 --> 06:53.430
You're doing great! Keep it up!

07:24.070 --> 07:26.180
That was refreshing!

07:26.180 --> 07:27.460
Wow!

07:27.460 --> 07:29.070
Did you practice this dance?

07:29.070 --> 07:31.030
Nah, not at all.

07:31.030 --> 07:34.300
You would've gotten an amazing score if you didn't miss the start!

07:34.300 --> 07:38.190
Just goes to show how good you can get when you practice for so long.

07:38.890 --> 07:41.560
Idol Research Club

07:38.890 --> 07:41.560
Otonokizaka Academy

07:38.890 --> 07:41.560
Muse

07:47.000 --> 07:48.150
See you later!

07:48.150 --> 07:50.310
Okay, thanks for today!

07:50.310 --> 07:51.310
Bye-bye!

07:51.310 --> 07:52.660
Bye-bye!

08:05.080 --> 08:05.970
So cute!

08:05.970 --> 08:06.880
Awesome!

08:06.880 --> 08:09.800
Everyone, come join us!

08:12.040 --> 08:15.210
I'm sure they'll become incredible idols.

08:17.810 --> 08:20.060
Look! A-RISE is on the screen!

08:20.580 --> 08:22.590
Wow, they're so cute!

08:21.000 --> 08:24.560
Next time, I want to do something that won't make anybody sad.

08:25.300 --> 08:29.400
Something that'll allow me to do things my way
and have fun at the same time.

08:29.400 --> 08:33.250
Something I can give my all while making everyone smile.

08:36.160 --> 08:39.120
I wonder if something like that exists.

08:42.120 --> 08:44.150
Kayo-chin, you've gotta be faster!

08:44.150 --> 08:45.330
S-Sorry!

08:45.860 --> 08:48.490
Doing this is pretty tough after not practicing for a while!

08:51.130 --> 08:53.510
Rin-chan! Hanayo-chan!

08:53.510 --> 08:54.830
Honoka-chan!

08:54.830 --> 08:56.950
You're still practicing, huh?

08:57.800 --> 08:58.730
Yeah.

08:58.730 --> 09:00.100
Of course they are!

09:00.100 --> 09:02.310
We haven't quit being school idols.

09:03.310 --> 09:04.310
Got a problem with that?

09:04.760 --> 09:05.730
No.

09:05.730 --> 09:10.970
µ's went on hiatus, but that doesn't mean we all have to stop being school idols.

09:10.970 --> 09:12.510
But why continue?

09:14.240 --> 09:15.280
Because I love it.

09:16.780 --> 09:19.070
I love idols!

09:19.070 --> 09:24.040
They sing and dance in front of an audience, getting everyone excited.

09:24.040 --> 09:30.800
That's the kind of idol I love! The kind that can motivate everyone to work hard the next day!

09:31.840 --> 09:34.750
My love is different from your half-hearted love!

09:34.750 --> 09:36.510
You're wrong! I also...

09:36.510 --> 09:37.760
How am I wrong?

09:38.560 --> 09:42.790
You're the one who quit, saying it was pointless to continue.

09:42.790 --> 09:44.290
That's...

09:44.290 --> 09:45.930
You're being too hard on her.

09:47.100 --> 09:49.150
No, Nico-chan's right.

09:50.020 --> 09:51.890
Sorry for interrupting.

09:53.110 --> 09:54.290
Honoka-chan!

09:55.900 --> 09:59.710
We're thinking of holding a live show by ourselves.

10:00.720 --> 10:02.330
If you'd like to come, please do.

10:02.330 --> 10:05.290
We'd love to have you!

10:05.290 --> 10:07.250
You're the one who started it all!

10:07.250 --> 10:08.790
You're coming. No excuses.

10:09.340 --> 10:10.710
You guys...

10:13.920 --> 10:16.760
Yukiho, is this a cream puff?

10:16.760 --> 10:19.210
No, silly. It has red bean paste inside.

10:19.210 --> 10:20.930
They're basically boiled beans.

10:20.930 --> 10:21.970
Horosho!

10:21.970 --> 10:25.250
Thanks for bringing it home for her.

10:25.250 --> 10:27.230
If you don't mind, please come inside.

10:27.620 --> 10:29.670
I'm sure my sister will be happy to see you.

10:32.220 --> 10:33.070
Sorry.

10:33.070 --> 10:35.430
It's not like I was busy. Make yourself at home.

10:35.430 --> 10:36.280
I'll pour you some tea.

10:36.280 --> 10:37.930
That's not why I'm apologizing.

10:37.930 --> 10:41.380
I'm apologizing for putting µ's on hiatus.

10:41.380 --> 10:45.240
It wasn't my decision to make, but I couldn't control myself.

10:46.540 --> 10:47.700
I'm sorry.

10:48.110 --> 10:50.250
I-I don't mind.

10:50.840 --> 10:53.540
Besides, this happened because I quit.

10:54.220 --> 10:55.050
You know,

10:55.580 --> 10:59.800
people say I'm very disciplined and calm,

10:59.800 --> 11:02.050
but that couldn't be further from the truth.

11:02.540 --> 11:03.630
Eri-chan...

11:03.630 --> 11:07.430
I'm hesitant, indecisive, and I always feel like crying.

11:07.430 --> 11:11.060
Nozomi has seen me at my most embarrassing.

11:11.880 --> 11:15.610
But I hide my weak side.

11:16.740 --> 11:19.150
I wish I could be like you.

11:19.150 --> 11:24.330
I admire how you're upfront with your feelings and don't hesitate to act on them.

11:24.940 --> 11:26.490
That's putting it too nicely.

11:29.160 --> 11:30.110
It's good.

11:31.800 --> 11:33.410
To tell you the truth, Honoka...

11:34.800 --> 11:40.070
I don't know what to say to you.

11:40.070 --> 11:44.310
We were all shocked to hear that Kotori's leaving,

11:44.310 --> 11:47.810
so it pains me to imagine how you and Umi-chan are taking this.

11:47.810 --> 11:48.680
But...

11:49.040 --> 11:52.690
you taught me about what matters most:

11:53.940 --> 11:57.440
the courage to move on without fearing change.

12:01.720 --> 12:06.390
Back then, your hand saved me.

12:54.960 --> 12:57.570
Are you sure you don't want to say goodbye to everyone?

12:57.570 --> 13:01.670
Yeah. I'll just end up crying again if I try.

13:02.050 --> 13:02.970
All right.

13:02.970 --> 13:05.700
You can see me off here, Mom.

13:05.700 --> 13:08.140
I'll call you right away when I get there!

13:08.140 --> 13:09.010
Kotori!

13:11.520 --> 13:13.350
Take care of yourself.

13:41.710 --> 13:45.010
Sorry for calling you out here. I hope I'm not bothering you.

13:45.010 --> 13:45.760
You aren't.

13:46.550 --> 13:47.760
Where's Kotori-chan?

13:48.300 --> 13:50.390
She's leaving Japan today.

13:51.140 --> 13:52.510
I see.

13:54.850 --> 13:56.230
Honoka...

13:56.230 --> 13:59.310
When we did our first live show here

13:59.310 --> 14:01.980
and I performed with you and Kotori-chan,

14:02.400 --> 14:06.110
I knew I wanted to sing more, to be a school idol.

14:07.030 --> 14:10.260
Even though I quit, that feeling never changed.

14:10.790 --> 14:14.120
It's not for the school or for Love Live.

14:14.120 --> 14:16.710
I just love singing!

14:17.330 --> 14:18.870
I'm passionate about that, if nothing else.

14:19.710 --> 14:20.670
So...

14:21.500 --> 14:22.750
I'm sorry!

14:23.750 --> 14:26.170
I'll probably start causing you problems again.

14:26.170 --> 14:29.640
I might even get too wrapped up in what I'm doing and fail to notice when others are worrying,

14:29.640 --> 14:32.350
or try too hard and ruin everyone's hard work again!

14:32.350 --> 14:34.520
I'm just that awkward!

14:34.520 --> 14:36.600
But I want to keep going!

14:37.100 --> 14:40.230
I know I'm being selfish, but I...

14:45.480 --> 14:47.530
Umi-chan, why are you laughing?

14:47.530 --> 14:50.030
I'm being serious here!

14:50.030 --> 14:51.410
I'm sorry.

14:52.490 --> 14:53.530
It's just...

14:54.280 --> 14:55.950
Let me make this clear.

14:58.960 --> 15:02.500
You've been causing us problems for as long as we've known you.

15:03.500 --> 15:06.050
Kotori and I would often talk about it.

15:06.050 --> 15:09.510
When we're with you, you always get us into trouble.

15:10.130 --> 15:13.850
Try as we may, we can never get you to listen to reason.

15:14.220 --> 15:16.890
Take this school idol thing, for example.

15:16.890 --> 15:19.140
I seriously didn't want to do it.

15:19.140 --> 15:20.190
Umi-chan...

15:20.190 --> 15:23.110
I tried to quit every chance I got.

15:23.110 --> 15:25.190
I was even angry at you.

15:25.730 --> 15:28.190
My feelings probably flew right over your head, though.

15:28.940 --> 15:29.700
Sorry.

15:30.280 --> 15:33.530
But you always take us places.

15:35.620 --> 15:40.040
Great places where Kotori and I can't reach on our own because we lack courage.

15:41.460 --> 15:42.960
Umi-chan!

15:42.960 --> 15:47.960
I wasn't angry because you didn't notice how Kotori felt.

15:47.960 --> 15:51.930
I was angry because I could tell you were denying how you truly felt.

15:52.470 --> 15:56.100
We're used to you getting your way.

15:56.100 --> 15:58.470
So, in return, take us there!

15:59.560 --> 16:01.480
To a world we've never seen before!

16:02.390 --> 16:04.980
Your ability to do that is what makes you so amazing.

16:05.610 --> 16:09.690
Kotori, I, and everyone else in µ's agree!

16:19.710 --> 16:24.460
I feel we have a chance

16:24.460 --> 16:29.200
Yes, let's push forward

16:29.200 --> 16:32.100
I don't want to regret it later

16:32.100 --> 16:39.140
Our future lies right ahead

16:39.140 --> 16:41.350
Now, Kotori is waiting!

16:40.940 --> 16:42.580
Let's go!

16:42.580 --> 16:45.120
Do! I do!

16:43.100 --> 16:43.770
What?

16:43.770 --> 16:45.270
But Kotori-chan's...

16:43.920 --> 16:44.560
I

16:44.560 --> 16:45.120
do!

16:45.120 --> 16:46.080
I live! Yes!

16:45.270 --> 16:46.810
She's just like me.

16:45.520 --> 16:45.780
live!

16:45.780 --> 16:46.040
Yes!

16:46.080 --> 16:48.790
Do! I do!

16:46.810 --> 16:49.150
Kotori wants you to lead her.

16:48.790 --> 16:50.120
I live!

16:49.150 --> 16:50.900
She wants you to be selfish.

16:49.600 --> 16:50.120
live!

16:50.120 --> 16:52.130
Let's go! Let's go! Hi!

16:51.990 --> 16:53.150
Yes.

16:53.150 --> 16:56.370
She found favor with a famous designer, and no one would tell her to stay.

16:55.050 --> 16:56.600
One, two, three, four!

16:57.740 --> 17:00.700
The only one who can be selfish with her is...

17:01.860 --> 17:04.360
Look ahead, look up

17:04.360 --> 17:06.880
Don't wait for anything

17:06.880 --> 17:09.240
Let's go now, let's go quickly

17:09.340 --> 17:11.880
We can go anywhere

17:11.880 --> 17:14.420
The sun's shining

17:14.420 --> 17:16.920
And beckoning the future

17:16.130 --> 17:16.930
Kotori-chan!

17:16.920 --> 17:19.070
Now, come. You come too

17:19.070 --> 17:22.240
Forge ahead to tomorrow

17:22.390 --> 17:24.180
Kotori-chan, don't go!

17:22.940 --> 17:25.460
My passionate heart

17:24.180 --> 17:27.100
I want to be a school idol!

17:24.370 --> 17:26.540
Was overflowing with emotions

17:25.540 --> 17:27.880
I embraced it and ran

17:26.980 --> 17:29.440
It was painful

17:27.100 --> 17:29.560
I want to be a school idol with you,

17:27.880 --> 17:30.380
Everyone, come with me

17:29.440 --> 17:31.780
I want to move my body more

17:29.940 --> 17:33.530
even if we end up pursuing a different dream someday!

17:31.780 --> 17:36.140
And make sure I know what I'm capable of

17:35.530 --> 17:36.490
Don't go!

17:36.780 --> 17:39.520
Let's go! It's still the same world

17:38.870 --> 17:40.740
I owe you an apology.

17:39.520 --> 17:41.850
Do! I do! I live!

17:40.920 --> 17:40.920
Hi, hi, hi!

17:41.410 --> 17:45.540
I knew what I really wanted to do, and yet...

17:41.700 --> 17:42.480
hi!

17:41.850 --> 17:44.540
Let's go, as long as there's a chance

17:44.540 --> 17:46.850
I won't give up

17:46.850 --> 17:49.600
Let's go! With a natural smile

17:49.750 --> 17:51.550
I'm so nervous!

17:51.550 --> 17:54.510
We're gonna be performing in our school uniforms, you guys!

17:51.810 --> 17:52.390
hi!

17:51.820 --> 17:54.660
Let's go! I'm starting to see potential

17:54.510 --> 17:56.930
Well, we <i>are</i> school idols.

17:54.660 --> 17:56.910
We can shine when we're cheerful

17:56.930 --> 17:59.640
Will Honoka and Kotori get here in time?

17:57.080 --> 17:59.330
There's a place for us

17:59.330 --> 18:00.780
Let's go!

17:59.640 --> 18:00.930
They will.

18:00.930 --> 18:01.810
No matter what.

18:01.810 --> 18:04.810
But it's almost time to go out.

18:04.810 --> 18:07.560
We can't afford to keep our audience waiting.

18:08.480 --> 18:11.780
Let's go! Let's go! Hi!

18:13.190 --> 18:14.700
Ow!

18:14.700 --> 18:15.610
Honoka-chan?!

18:15.610 --> 18:16.860
Kotori!

18:18.200 --> 18:19.530
Thanks for waiting!

18:19.530 --> 18:21.990
You had us worried.

18:22.910 --> 18:26.330
Now that we're all here, say something, President.

18:26.330 --> 18:27.830
What?!

18:27.830 --> 18:29.420
Just kidding.

18:29.420 --> 18:31.080
I thought of something to say this time.

18:31.590 --> 18:34.840
Let's put the biggest smile on everyone's face!

18:34.840 --> 18:35.510
One!

18:35.510 --> 18:36.130
Two!

18:36.130 --> 18:36.800
Three!

18:36.800 --> 18:37.470
Four!

18:37.470 --> 18:38.130
Five!

18:38.130 --> 18:38.800
Six!

18:38.800 --> 18:39.470
Seven!

18:39.470 --> 18:40.140
Eight!

18:40.140 --> 18:40.800
Nine!

18:41.180 --> 18:43.260
All right, let's go!

18:51.020 --> 18:55.170
I say

18:55.170 --> 18:58.460
Hey, hey, hey, Start:Dash!!

19:01.400 --> 19:04.890
Hey, hey, hey, Start:Dash!!

19:07.890 --> 19:11.110
Even newborn baby birds

19:11.110 --> 19:14.350
Leave the nest and fly into the sky someday

19:14.350 --> 19:19.450
Beating their big, strong wings

19:20.600 --> 19:23.760
